WEBVTT

00:01.626 --> 00:02.544
EPISODE 9

00:02.627 --> 00:05.714
Hey, welcome. What brings you in today?
Picking up your last order?

00:05.797 --> 00:09.300
Yes, I'm here to pick up
the conjuring ink I ordered.

00:09.384 --> 00:12.929
Also, my staff has cracked.
I'd like to have it repaired.

00:13.013 --> 00:15.682
The light was so bright.

00:15.765 --> 00:18.435
It's strange that Grandpa didn't see it.

00:19.561 --> 00:22.355
Maybe Qifrey knows something about it.

00:24.024 --> 00:27.068
Or could it be that this person...

00:35.285 --> 00:38.705
I'm so sorry!

00:38.788 --> 00:42.167
Using the Grasping Wind
just to grab mountain apples?

00:42.667 --> 00:45.670
It seems your seal was
a little too big, wasn't it?

00:46.171 --> 00:49.340
Yes. At first, the ring was small.

00:50.050 --> 00:54.220
It only shook the apples,
so I figured I'd make it stronger, but...

00:54.304 --> 00:57.307
What if you angled
the Pull Arrows and twisted them?

00:57.807 --> 01:00.852
Look, when you pick an apple,
you twist them off.

01:00.935 --> 01:02.103
Good thinking.

01:02.187 --> 01:07.108
If you change the arrows to suit the goal,
you can apply magic in countless ways.

01:09.944 --> 01:12.572
When you fail, look for the reason.

01:12.655 --> 01:15.033
Even if you succeed,
ask yourself why it worked.

01:15.533 --> 01:19.245
Repetitive practice is for finding
weak spots and fixing them.

01:19.329 --> 01:22.624
Good review isn't just
mindless repetition. Right, Master?

01:22.707 --> 01:24.375
Precisely.

01:24.459 --> 01:27.879
You're good at teaching, Master Tetia.

01:28.588 --> 01:31.466
Master Tetia?

01:32.217 --> 01:34.052
I'm so happy! I'm blushing!

01:34.135 --> 01:36.763
Say it again!

01:39.307 --> 01:42.811
Do you really have time
to be looking after other people?

01:43.311 --> 01:45.814
If you know you're still inexperienced,

01:45.897 --> 01:48.191
why not put it into your own practice?

01:52.195 --> 01:55.365
We'll practice for sure,
so show us how it's done!

01:55.448 --> 01:57.784
Wait, I didn't call you two here!

01:57.867 --> 02:01.246
I'm too busy studying for the test
to be messing around.

02:06.334 --> 02:11.131
Do tests like the Consent of the Crown
from the Dadah Range exist anywhere else?

02:12.340 --> 02:13.174
They do.

02:15.093 --> 02:17.637
There are five, and I don't get the point.

02:17.720 --> 02:19.889
I can draw just fine without tests.

02:19.973 --> 02:23.643
You do them to test yourself
and understand yourself.

02:23.726 --> 02:28.231
Whether it's meaningful or not
depends on how you choose to approach it.

02:28.982 --> 02:35.196
That said, unless you take it on
willingly, it's hard to enjoy anything.

02:35.697 --> 02:39.033
It seems the old witches struggled
with the same thing.

02:39.117 --> 02:42.328
Magic exists to make people happy.

02:42.412 --> 02:45.623
If apprentices are suffering,
that defeats the purpose.

02:45.707 --> 02:47.542
So the Three Sages thought hard

02:47.625 --> 02:50.753
and turned the tests
into outer-world adventures

02:50.837 --> 02:52.881
everyone would want to take on.

02:56.426 --> 02:58.970
Earn his pardon and become an apprentice.

02:59.053 --> 03:01.598
First test, Consent of the Crown.

03:02.348 --> 03:04.601
Show your devotion
and walk with your master.

03:04.684 --> 03:07.478
Second test, The Knight's Loyalty.

03:08.396 --> 03:10.481
If your path is true, you gain the key.

03:10.982 --> 03:13.776
Third test, The Gatekeeper's Question.

03:14.527 --> 03:16.905
Fulfill your wish and stand on your own.

03:16.988 --> 03:19.866
Fourth test, The Queen's Blessing.

03:20.575 --> 03:22.994
Thou art the one who teaches.

03:23.077 --> 03:25.955
Fifth test, The Sage's Teaching.

03:26.456 --> 03:29.209
These are the witches' Pentagram Tests.

03:29.709 --> 03:35.632
With each step, the magic you may use
and the work you're allowed to do expands.

03:35.715 --> 03:38.426
The fourth test makes you
a full-fledged witch,

03:38.509 --> 03:40.220
and you graduate from your master.

03:40.720 --> 03:45.391
You can challenge the Tower of Tomes
only after completing the third test.

03:48.102 --> 03:50.772
The final test is
about taking apprentices of your own.

03:50.855 --> 03:53.900
So don't think about graduating just yet.

03:53.983 --> 03:55.151
What?

03:55.235 --> 03:59.322
Well, I think about life after graduating
a lot.

03:59.405 --> 04:05.620
Traveling so far away,
helping all kinds of people with magic.

04:05.703 --> 04:10.041
I want to hear all kinds of people
from around the world thank me.

04:10.124 --> 04:14.545
The people who give thanks,
and the people who receive them.

04:14.629 --> 04:17.173
One spell, two kinds of happiness,

04:17.257 --> 04:19.300
Isn't that just amazing?

04:19.384 --> 04:22.553
You kill two birds with one stone.
A total win-win!

04:22.637 --> 04:26.307
Joy always comes in twin tails!

04:26.391 --> 04:31.896
So I want to grow up fast
and design a witch hat with two horns.

04:31.980 --> 04:34.107
So that's what your hairstyle means!

04:34.190 --> 04:37.902
Once you're a full-fledged witch,
you also get to choose your own hat.

04:38.403 --> 04:40.863
I hate tests.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.324
They're a pain.

04:43.408 --> 04:47.745
I don't want to draw magic I don't like
just because someone tells me to.

04:48.246 --> 04:50.581
If you only draw magic you like...

04:52.667 --> 04:55.962
your repertoire will never grow.

05:02.468 --> 05:03.761
I don't care if it doesn't grow.

05:04.762 --> 05:09.267
If being a grown-up means
having to do things you don't want to,

05:09.350 --> 05:11.311
then I'm fine just the way I am.

05:12.145 --> 05:13.730
I'm leaving now.

05:16.733 --> 05:20.653
I hate the idea of staying as I am.

05:20.737 --> 05:22.822
There's too much I still can't do.

05:23.406 --> 05:25.325
I want to take each test as soon as I can.

05:26.034 --> 05:29.620
And someday
become a librarian of the Tower of Tomes.

05:30.288 --> 05:33.207
I'd grow up this instant if I could.

05:34.792 --> 05:39.797
Agott's family descends from an apprentice
the Three Sages left their memories to.

05:39.881 --> 05:41.716
They've been librarians for ages.

05:41.799 --> 05:44.969
I think it was the Arklaum family.

05:46.429 --> 05:49.682
So Agott's aiming
for the Tower of Tomes too.

05:51.017 --> 05:52.060
And you, Coco?

05:53.144 --> 05:55.813
What kind of witch
do you want to be, Coco?

05:55.897 --> 05:59.233
My starting point is
different from everyone else's.

05:59.317 --> 06:01.819
So what I need to do is already decided.

06:04.697 --> 06:08.618
Anyway, first I have to learn
a lot more magic I can use.

06:09.202 --> 06:10.370
All right.

06:10.453 --> 06:13.373
- Let's draw Grasping Wind one more time!
- Yeah!

06:13.456 --> 06:17.126
Draw it, and you'll learn it.
Learn it, and you can use it.

06:17.210 --> 06:22.340
The power you build up that way
will never betray you.

07:57.101 --> 07:59.187
What? Where is everyone?

07:59.687 --> 08:02.940
It's dark already. When did night come?

08:13.576 --> 08:14.619
Mom!

08:15.411 --> 08:17.747
Mom! I'm sorry.

08:17.830 --> 08:20.625
It's all my fault. I'm the one to blame.

08:20.708 --> 08:22.710
I never meant to hurt anybody.

08:22.793 --> 08:25.213
I just couldn't give up on magic...

08:28.633 --> 08:31.093
This is why I told you again and again.

08:32.386 --> 08:34.430
Ordinary people just can't do it.

08:36.390 --> 08:37.308
Mom...

08:37.391 --> 08:39.852
You ignorant Outsider.

08:40.353 --> 08:42.688
It's all your fault, Coco.

08:43.397 --> 08:48.110
Turning your mother to stone,
dragging us into danger.

08:48.194 --> 08:50.947
And you'll say
you never meant to, won't you?

08:52.532 --> 08:54.867
I want nothing to do with Brimmed Caps.

08:54.951 --> 08:57.703
There are things people can do
and things they can't.

08:57.787 --> 09:00.206
There must be no exceptions.

09:00.289 --> 09:02.959
It was all hidden so this wouldn't happen.

09:15.888 --> 09:19.225
This happened
because you wished for magic.

09:19.308 --> 09:21.060
It's all your fault.

09:22.019 --> 09:25.022
It's your fault
the world is falling apart!

09:50.840 --> 09:51.716
Master.

09:51.799 --> 09:53.217
Are you still awake?

09:53.301 --> 09:54.969
I didn't want to waste time.

09:55.052 --> 09:57.638
That won't do.
Don't push yourself too hard.

09:57.722 --> 09:59.724
Okay. I'm going to bed.

10:08.024 --> 10:09.984
So you're up too.

10:11.444 --> 10:12.862
I just can't sleep.

10:13.738 --> 10:14.864
I see.

10:18.993 --> 10:22.413
Draw it, and you'll learn it.
Learn it, and you can use it.

10:23.080 --> 10:28.878
How much more do I have to learn
before I can save my mom?

10:37.803 --> 10:39.388
I've been waiting

10:40.431 --> 10:41.682
all this time...

10:45.061 --> 10:47.605
for this day to come.

10:48.773 --> 10:54.695
Those who resisted the Three Sages' choice
to ban magic on human bodies to the end

10:54.779 --> 10:58.282
were the good magic doctors
who used their magic to heal.

10:59.408 --> 11:03.496
Lost from memory along with them
was the magic of the twin vials,

11:03.579 --> 11:06.290
a healing magic created to share medicine.

11:07.124 --> 11:09.919
Even if one was in a faraway land,

11:10.002 --> 11:14.256
their contents were shared
through medallions engraved with a ring,

11:14.340 --> 11:17.301
so whatever was needed never ran empty.

11:18.177 --> 11:19.804
Ever since the Day of the Pact,

11:19.887 --> 11:23.182
this old, delicate healing magic
has been long-lost.

11:23.683 --> 11:26.811
How ironic
that the Brimmed Caps can recreate it.

11:27.478 --> 11:30.189
Beautiful magic,
but I'll be taking it apart.

11:30.690 --> 11:33.025
It's my only way to reach them.

11:35.027 --> 11:39.573
I won't touch the conjuring ink just yet.
Unknown power is dangerous.

11:40.282 --> 11:45.454
What I'm after is the medallion
engraved with a seal inside the vial.

11:45.538 --> 11:48.457
Can I extract it
without the other side noticing?

11:49.542 --> 11:52.086
This belongs to them.

11:52.586 --> 11:55.506
Drop this medallion into the guidance orb,

11:56.006 --> 11:59.343
and its contents, owner, place of origin,

11:59.427 --> 12:02.054
every trace becomes
a needle pointing to them.

12:03.556 --> 12:05.474
Instead of relying on minor clues,

12:05.558 --> 12:08.728
I can pin down
a far more certain location.

12:16.527 --> 12:19.029
A Lightning Strike Spell? Did they notice?

12:25.119 --> 12:26.704
Water? This is bad!

12:38.048 --> 12:41.594
I let my guard down.
My magic is useless underwater.

13:13.292 --> 13:14.335
You...

13:15.211 --> 13:16.545
The eyeball...

13:22.885 --> 13:23.719
Wa...

13:26.096 --> 13:27.389
wait.

13:30.100 --> 13:30.976
I'm not

13:32.520 --> 13:33.938
done.

13:41.862 --> 13:44.740
Damn it. I won't give up.

13:45.616 --> 13:50.538
I'll take back what you stole from me.

13:56.210 --> 13:59.046
And after giving it to that girl...

13:59.630 --> 14:02.299
Aw, it's all ruined now.

14:13.936 --> 14:15.062
Your yawns matched.

14:15.145 --> 14:18.315
You've been at it all day.
Did you two stay up late?

14:19.608 --> 14:22.319
I know!
Every night, you turn into magic knights

14:22.403 --> 14:24.280
and cut down the enemies! Slash!

14:24.363 --> 14:26.866
Transformation is forbidden magic.

14:26.949 --> 14:30.911
If you can't stop yawning,
you should be sleeping properly at night.

14:31.662 --> 14:35.916
You've been up practicing late
into the night past these few days, right?

14:37.459 --> 14:40.588
Well, the brush just flows late at night...

14:40.671 --> 14:42.548
What? That's no good, Coco!

14:42.631 --> 14:45.676
I get how you feel,
but overdoing it is bad.

14:45.759 --> 14:47.970
Good magic comes from good sleep.

14:48.053 --> 14:49.054
And food.

14:49.138 --> 14:51.098
Master Olu said so too.

14:51.181 --> 14:54.894
Sleep while you're a kid,
or you'll break down when you grow up.

14:54.977 --> 14:56.061
That's right.

14:56.145 --> 15:00.566
I'll brew some herbal sleep tea.
Master, would you like some too?

15:04.069 --> 15:05.070
Master?

15:06.280 --> 15:08.073
Sorry, what were you saying?

15:08.157 --> 15:09.658
So sorry.

15:09.742 --> 15:12.036
I zoned out after eating.

15:12.119 --> 15:13.662
I'll make the tea.

15:15.539 --> 15:16.540
Ouch!

15:20.544 --> 15:23.088
Master, are you really okay?

15:23.172 --> 15:24.965
Yeah, I'm fine.

15:26.884 --> 15:29.553
The numbness from yesterday is still here.

15:30.054 --> 15:34.266
Ah, shoot.
I ruined the last of the alub tea.

15:34.350 --> 15:36.435
I'll go out and gather some leaves.

15:36.518 --> 15:39.229
You all keep working
through the basic spellbook.

15:40.397 --> 15:42.650
I'll clean up later, okay?

15:48.489 --> 15:50.491
Master seems off today.

15:50.574 --> 15:53.744
Sleep deprivation really does have
a huge effect

15:55.329 --> 15:57.289
Tonight, he's sentenced to alub tea.

15:57.373 --> 15:58.749
Hey, Agott.

15:59.458 --> 16:01.502
Can I borrow you a sec?

16:06.882 --> 16:08.384
I'm returning these.

16:08.467 --> 16:10.719
My sylph shoes.

16:10.803 --> 16:13.222
Sorry it took so long to give them back.

16:13.305 --> 16:16.684
I wanted to draw it cleanly,
and it ended up taking a while.

16:18.227 --> 16:20.354
Were you working on this last night?

16:20.437 --> 16:21.647
Yeah.

16:21.730 --> 16:25.150
But my seal isn't as good
as everyone else's.

16:25.234 --> 16:28.278
Try them on,
and redraw it if they fly badly.

16:32.908 --> 16:34.535
What are you playing at?

16:36.370 --> 16:38.205
What are you scheming?

16:39.748 --> 16:41.542
It's been bothering me.

16:41.625 --> 16:44.920
What happened during the first,
Consent of the Crown.

16:45.421 --> 16:50.676
You never told Master Qifrey
I forced you into it, did you?

16:51.301 --> 16:54.346
You could even talk to Olruggio about it.

16:55.055 --> 17:00.352
And instead of blaming me,
you go and repair my sylph shoes.

17:01.562 --> 17:06.817
Why? I have no idea
what goes on in your head.

17:09.278 --> 17:10.446
That day...

17:11.030 --> 17:12.948
It's true you were pushy.

17:13.032 --> 17:16.660
The test scared me back then,
and being alone left me forlorn.

17:17.786 --> 17:20.956
I could've just waited to be picked up,
doing nothing.

17:22.041 --> 17:23.042
But...

17:24.835 --> 17:27.755
standing at the foot
of the Dadah Range that day

17:27.838 --> 17:30.466
and deciding to take it on
was my own choice.

17:31.258 --> 17:36.472
I think the one I wanted to prove
I could do it to was myself.

17:37.222 --> 17:41.560
That, with my own magic, I could
overcome hardship and someday grasp hope.

17:44.146 --> 17:45.189
Otherwise...

17:50.360 --> 17:52.154
Then what is this?

17:52.237 --> 17:55.699
Was I the only one
who kept worrying about it?

17:55.783 --> 17:57.076
That means...

18:21.600 --> 18:24.394
Good. The feeling's coming back.

18:26.021 --> 18:27.815
Did they think it odd?

18:27.898 --> 18:30.150
They're sharp kids. They may have noticed.

18:30.651 --> 18:34.571
If they find out, it's over.
I have to hide it, no matter what.

18:35.197 --> 18:37.449
Will you keep it a secret for me,
Fluff-Fluff?

18:39.034 --> 18:41.078
That face says you don't like your name.

18:43.413 --> 18:46.041
I think it's cute though.

18:46.625 --> 18:47.543
Fluff-Fluff.

18:47.626 --> 18:48.794
You hate it that much?

18:49.628 --> 18:51.046
Master!

19:01.473 --> 19:05.519
You startled me, Agott.
That was incredible speed.

19:06.019 --> 19:10.065
The heel arrow was too long,
so the seal came out warped.

19:10.149 --> 19:12.568
Really? I'd love to see it.

19:12.651 --> 19:15.320
Never mind that. It's an emergency.

19:15.404 --> 19:16.780
- It's Coco!
- What?

19:20.450 --> 19:22.286
I'll take her to the hospital in Kalhn.

19:22.369 --> 19:24.413
Sure. Leave things here to me.

19:25.622 --> 19:28.792
Everyone, if anything comes up, go to Olu.

19:42.097 --> 19:44.808
Hang in there.
We're almost at the hospital.

19:46.310 --> 19:50.063
Her fever's rising.
I have to get her to a doctor, fast.

19:57.654 --> 20:00.115
- Okay, my turn next.
- Don't mess it up.

20:00.199 --> 20:01.283
Yeah, here goes!

20:02.075 --> 20:04.745
Wait for it... Take this!

20:07.789 --> 20:09.499
Catch it properly.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.710
Tartah, leaving already?

20:12.294 --> 20:15.130
Sorry. I've got a ferry to catch.

20:15.214 --> 20:18.217
- I see.
- You live on the river island, right?

20:18.800 --> 20:23.722
Weird. If you're from a witch family,
you could just fly home.

20:23.805 --> 20:24.932
Yeah, right?

20:26.558 --> 20:29.728
There are all kinds of rules.

20:29.811 --> 20:31.230
Lame.

20:31.313 --> 20:34.066
- See you tomorrow!
- See you!

20:38.111 --> 20:41.073
People who don't know
just say whatever they want.

20:43.116 --> 20:44.493
The truth is, I...

20:46.078 --> 20:47.204
Whoa!

20:49.331 --> 20:51.959
What? Qifrey?

20:54.461 --> 20:56.088
- Why are you here?
- Tartah.

20:56.171 --> 20:58.257
The hospital's just ahead, right?

20:58.340 --> 21:00.259
I wasn't sure I was going the right way.

21:01.093 --> 21:05.389
Yeah, the hospital.
This way! I know a shortcut!

21:05.889 --> 21:07.015
Thank you.

21:26.076 --> 21:27.119
Please, help her.

21:27.202 --> 21:30.789
Yes, we'll take her.
Please wait a little while.

21:34.418 --> 21:36.336
I hope she'll be fine.

21:37.129 --> 21:38.463
You saved us, Tartah.

21:39.089 --> 21:40.966
How did you know a route like that?

21:41.466 --> 21:44.803
- Anyone could manage that much.
- No, it's impressive.

21:45.345 --> 21:47.806
You've got a sharp eye.

21:48.473 --> 21:50.767
You really observe things, don't you?

21:54.271 --> 21:56.815
Listen, Qifrey.

21:57.524 --> 22:01.361
There's something I want to ask you.

23:33.787 --> 23:35.997
Subtitle translation by: Emily Noguchi

23:36.581 --> 23:41.002
EPISODE 10
